功能对应关系
CLI命令           Web API端点                      HTTP方法
new               /api/notes                       POST
list              /api/notes                       GET
view <id>         /api/notes/{id}                  GET
edit content      /api/notes/{id}/content          PUT
edit title        /api/notes/{id}/title            PUT
delete            /api/notes/{id}                  DELETE
tag add           /api/notes/{id}/tags             POST
tag remove        /api/notes/{id}/tags/{tag}       DELETE
search            /api/notes/search?keyword={}     GET
tags list         /api/tags                        GET
tags stats        /api/tags/statistics             GET
tags search       /api/tags/{tag}/notes            GET